<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v2.3 20070202//EN" "archivearticle.dtd"><article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" article-type="research-article"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">Ulster Med J</journal-id><journal-title>The Ulster Medical Journal</journal-title><issn pub-type="ppub">0041-6193</issn></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmid">3445387</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2448229</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="pmid">3445387</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Articles</subject></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>Henoch-Sch&#x000f6;nlein purpura: problems in surgical diagnosis and management</article-title></title-group><contrib-group><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Potts</surname><given-names>S R</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Hamilton</surname><given-names>J R L</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Stewart</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Boston</surname><given-names>V E</given-names></name></contrib></contrib-group><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><month>10</month><year>1987</year></pub-date><volume>56</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>100</fpage><lpage>103</lpage><abstract><p>The clinico-pathological features of 133 consecutive cases of Henoch-Sch&#x000f6;nlein purpura are presented, with emphasis on the gastrointestinal manifestations. The potential pitfalls of contrast radiography are underlined with respect to management of intussusception and a plea is made to re-establish clinical assessment of the abdomen as the prime indicator in deciding to undertake laparotomy.</p></abstract></article-meta></front><body><supplementary-material content-type="scanned-pages"><graphic xlink:href="ulstermedj00086-0027.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="100" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/><graphic xlink:href="ulstermedj00086-0028.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="101" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/><graphic xlink:href="ulstermedj00086-0029.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="102" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/><graphic xlink:href="ulstermedj00086-0030.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="103" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/></supplementary-material></body></article>